<title>USA: U.S. barley weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. barley weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. barley major sales activity in the week ended Sept 5 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:     1996/97		 1997/98</p>
<p>Jordan	   50,000-A		  Nil</p>
<p>Israel	   20,600</p>
<p>A-switched from unknown destinations.</p>
<p>Exports of 25,700 tonnes were up 8 percent from the week before and up 92 percent from the four-week average.</p>
<p>Primary Export Destinations: Japan and Mexico.</p>
</text>
